WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,220
Qin Mumu

2
00:00:01,770 --> 00:00:04,650
Don’t you like to spread rumors about me having an affair with the cleaning lady behind my back?

3
00:00:05,260 --> 00:00:06,820
Then let you try it yourself

4
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:10,200
What does it feel like to be considered an interesting woman?

5
00:00:15,180 --> 00:00:16,140
Your name is Ghadami

6
00:00:16,660 --> 00:00:17,700
Come and sit here

7
00:00:18,260 --> 00:00:22,530
Sir, I'm just a waiter. I won't pay for the drinks.

8
00:00:26,100 --> 00:00:30,020
A Biao, take good care of Miss Qin

9
00:00:30,460 --> 00:00:32,460
This is Donghuang. What are you going to do?

10
00:00:32,700 --> 00:00:35,020
Miss Qin, have I heard about it?

11
00:00:35,740 --> 00:00:38,340
In Donghuang, you are the one left alone

12
00:00:38,860 --> 00:00:41,460
I regret not accepting Donghuang cover

13
00:00:42,060 --> 00:00:44,620
Why didn’t you take Sister Meng’s warning seriously?

14
00:00:45,140 --> 00:00:46,780
Miss Qin, don’t be afraid

15
00:00:47,610 --> 00:00:49,970
I just asked Miss Qin to perform a show

16
00:00:50,330 --> 00:00:54,920
Will die
